==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Teacher Bear is massively buffed, giving him an attack power of '''60,000'''. Tanking does not work, so bring cats that outrange him such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] along with disposable attackers that can deal with the Doge Darks. Long ranged Ubers will help greatly, as they can quickly kill Teacher Bear.

